# Lead Forms

Canonical detail: `docs/project/LEAD-FORMS.md`. Skill: `.cursor/skills/lead-forms/SKILL.md`.

## Phone

- Use shared `PhoneField` (`src/components/forms/phone-field.tsx`) on every lead form.
- Validate and store with `phoneE164Schema` / `isValidLeadPhone` (`src/domain/forms/phone.schema.ts`).
- Country UX (council C): controlled `country`; update flag only when typed value resolves uniquely or validates; shared codes like `+1` stay sticky until valid; dropdown picks are explicit.
- Country and marketplace dropdown panels must `createPortal` to `document.body` with `position: fixed`.
- Never `autoFocus` into a body portal. Focus with `element.focus({ preventScroll: true })` after layout, or the page jumps to the document end.
- Match sibling control height (`size="sm"` in compact `ConfigurableForm`). Labels use the same weight as sibling fields.
- Parent shells that force `[&_input]:border-*` must be beaten with `!border-0` on the inner tel input so the phone control reads as one field.

## Multi-select and chips

- Long option lists: `FormMultiSelect` (portaled panel).
- Short toggles: `FormOptionChips`.
- Server FormData: repeat hidden inputs named `marketplaces` / `services` (not a single `marketplaces[]` string the server cannot parse).

## Wizards (contact / free-audit)

- Render the **active step only**. Do not CSS-grid-stack invisible steps to “fix” CLS — that leaves huge empty space on short steps.
- Prefer portaled overlays over `overflow-y-auto` parents that clip dropdowns.
- Map `fieldErrors` back to the correct step via an explicit field→step table.

## Logging and notifications

- Redact phone and email in `sanitizeForLog` / server logs.
- Discord channel routing stays as configured (get-in-touch, full-funnel, service-lead separate when required).
